# HoKOS (Ultimate Gaming Edition)

High-performance system configuration optimized for **Honor of Kings** and top-tier competitive titles. 
Engineered specifically for **PC, Laptop, and Tablet** hardware.

## Performance Architecture
- **Target**: Native 165Hz Refresh Rate (Uncapped FPS support).
- **Core**: Real-time Preemption Kernel (PREEMPT_RT) for sub-millisecond input lag.
- **Motion**: Physics-based "Fluid Flow" animations (Tuned for 165Hz).
- **Network**: BBR TCP Congestion Control enabled for stable ping to CN servers.

## Visual & Audio Identity
- **Branding**: Integrated HoK Vector Branding on Start Menu.
- **UI**: Aero Glass Interface with Manual Resolution Control.
- **Cursor**: BlueStacks High-Contrast White (Size 64 for Ultra-HD).
- **Wallpaper**: Remastered Bliss (8K Lossless Source).
- **SFX**: Hardware Boot Chime / Legacy Shutdown SFX.

## Pre-configured Games
- Honor of Kings (HoK) - Core Priority.
- Genshin Impact / Honkai: Star Rail.
- Punishing: Gray Raven (PGR).
- Legacy Space Pinball (High-FPS).

## Usage
Execute `install.sh` with root privileges. Use `set-res` for manual display scaling.
#!/bin/bash
# HoKOS Deployment Script
# Precision Performance for Desktop & Tablet
# Strictly No Mobile/Phone Support

set -e

# --- Visual & Branding Setup ---
echo "Deploying HoKOS Branding..."
sudo cp ./assets/branding_logo.svg /usr/share/plasma/look-and-feel/aero/contents/images/start.svg
kwriteconfig6 --group "Mouse" --key "cursorTheme" "Contrast_White"
kwriteconfig6 --group "Mouse" --key "cursorSize" 64

# --- Manual Resolution & 165Hz Tuning ---
echo "Enforcing 165Hz Fluidity..."
kwriteconfig6 --file kwinrc --group "Compositing" --key "MaxFPS" 165
kwriteconfig6 --file kwinrc --group "Compositing" --key "RefreshRate" 165

# Manual Resolution Tool
sudo cat <<EOF > /usr/local/bin/set-res
#!/bin/bash
if [ -z "\$1" ] || [ -z "\$2" ]; then
    echo "Usage: set-res [width] [height]"
    exit 1
fi
wlr-randr --mode "\$1x\$2@165" || xrandr --size "\$1x\$2" --rate 165
EOF
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/set-res

# --- Audio Integration ---
sudo cp ./assets/boot_chime.wav /usr/share/sounds/
sudo cp ./assets/exit_sound.wav /usr/share/sounds/
echo "aplay /usr/share/sounds/boot_chime.wav &" >> ~/.config/autostart-scripts/boot.sh
echo "alias shutdown='aplay /usr/share/sounds/exit_sound.wav && poweroff'" >> ~/.bashrc

# --- Game Space Optimization ---
sudo cat <<EOF > /usr/local/bin/hok-mode
#!/bin/bash
# Maximum Resource Prioritization for HoKOS
echo "performance" | sudo tee /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu*/cpufreq/scaling_governor
echo 3 | sudo tee /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches
# Network Optimization
sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control=bbr
notify-send "HoKOS" "KING MODE ACTIVE - SYSTEM OPTIMIZED"
EOF
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/hok-mode

echo "HoKOS DEPLOYMENT COMPLETE. REBOOT TO APPLY CHANGES."
